abstract: >-
  An oracle-gated study of task-level complementarity among three local
  Qwen2.5-Coder tiers on 542 EvalPlus tasks. The same EvalPlus Plus result
  controlled cascade escalation and the final endpoint. The result supports
  non-nested pass sets under oracle gating, not independent-verifier,
  predictive-routing, equal-budget, or universal-efficiency superiority.
